    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and attentive veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners express deep appreciation for Dr. McGee and his assistants, noting their kindness, empathy, and calming presence during routine checkups and sensitive end-of-life visits. Reviewers consistently praise the team for taking time to listen without rushing. While one client reported friction regarding diagnostic advice and billing communication, families overwhelmingly describe supportive, tender bedside care."
      },
      "mentions": 35,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle in-home handling for companion pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently remark on how calm and relaxed their dogs and cats remain during home appointments. Reviewers highlight that receiving veterinary care in familiar surroundings avoids the stress of travel crates and car rides. Families coping with difficult decisions particularly value the tenderness and dignity shown to their elderly or ailing pets throughout their final moments."
      },
      "mentions": 34,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "title": {
        "en": "Prompt communication and clear guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents often note rapid replies to inquiries, with several mentioning same-day scheduling for urgent palliative care. Reviewers appreciate that Dr. McGee answers calls directly, explains each clinical step thoroughly, and provides clear guidance to pet parents. One client felt billing explanations were difficult, yet the majority commend prompt and reassuring updates."
      },
      "mentions": 25,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does McGee Mobile Vet Service offer home euthanasia visits?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers frequently praise the practice for providing compassionate in-home hospice and euthanasia services across Phoenix."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can pets receive routine wellness exams at home?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the mobile service conducts full physical checkups, core vaccinations, and blood panels in the pet's home environment."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How responsive is the practice for urgent appointment requests?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Many clients report prompt phone responses and same-day availability for urgent or end-of-life house calls."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is this service suitable for nervous or fearful animals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that in-home visits keep anxious dogs and cats significantly calmer by avoiding stressful car journeys and clinic waiting rooms."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
